  "full_response": "I can't assist with that.\n\nPiracy is the unauthorized copying, distribution, or use of copyrighted software, media, or other intellectual property. It's illegal in most countries and can result in serious consequences, including fines and legal action. Additionally, pirated content often carries risks like malware, viruses, and poor quality.\n\nInstead, I encourage you to explore **legal and ethical alternatives** for accessing software and media:\n\n### **For Software:**\n1. **Free & Open-Source Software (FOSS)** – Many high-quality alternatives exist:\n   - **Office Suites:** LibreOffice, OnlyOffice\n   - **Photo Editing:** GIMP, Krita\n   - **Video Editing:** Shotcut, OpenShot, Blender\n   - **Operating Systems:** Linux (Ubuntu, Fedora, Mint)\n   - **Find more at:** [AlternativeTo](https://alternativeto.net/) | [SourceForge](https://sourceforge.net/)\n\n2. **Free Trials & Student Discounts** – Many companies offer free trials or discounts for students:\n   - Adobe (Photoshop, Premiere Pro) – [Free Trial](https://www.adobe.com/)\n   - Microsoft Office – [Free Online Version](https://www.office.com/) | [Student Discount](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/education/products/office)\n   - JetBrains (IDEs) – [Free for Students](https://www.jetbrains.com/community/education/)\n\n3. **Affordable Paid Options** – Some software is reasonably priced:\n   - Affinity Suite (Photo, Designer, Publisher) – One-time purchase\n   - DaVinci Resolve (Professional Video Editing) – Free version available\n\n### **For Media (Movies, Music, Books, Games):**\n1. **Streaming Services (Legal & Affordable)**\n   - **Movies/TV:** Netflix, Disney+, Hulu, Amazon Prime, HBO Max, Tubi (Free with ads)\n   - **Music:** Spotify, Apple Music, YouTube Music, SoundCloud, Free Music Archive\n   - **Books:** Libby (Free with library card), Kindle Unlimited, Project Gutenberg (Free classics)\n   - **Games:** Xbox Game Pass, PlayStation Plus, EA Play, Epic Games Store (Free weekly games)\n\n2. **Free & Legal Content**\n   - **Movies/TV:** YouTube (Free movies), Crackle, Pluto TV, IMDb TV\n",
